{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-05-06 06:30:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE RELEASES THIRD QUARTER FISCAL 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, MAY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ:TECH) TODAY REPORTED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2021. THIRD QUARTER FY2021 SNAPSHOT THIRD QUARTER ORGANIC REVENUE INCREASED BY 22% (25% REPORTED) TO $243.6 MILLION AND 17% (19% REPORTED) IN THE FIRST NINE MONTHS OF FISCAL 2021 TO $672.0 MILLION.'}